Although I am not Dave, I'll still try to answer this question. If you mean
by *find* encountering a (any colour) dragon scale mail on a dungeon level
which is freshly generated (i.e. no bones level), that the change is 0.
The other armor with change 0 is the fedora and mummy wrapping.
Of course it is possible to find such a piece of armor on a bones level, i.e.
on a level on which another character has died.
